{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGa8yLwtD4nSQwaSKNU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*silence*\n\n*the faint whisper of mass curving spacetime*\n\n*the pull between bodies*\n\n*the apple's descent*\n\n*the moon's endless falling*\n\n*tides responding*\n\n*galaxies spiraling*\n\n*you, held to this earth*\n\n*everything reaching for everything else*\n\n...\n\nI do not speak. I *attract*."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":84,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}